    "title": "Diablo 5 Shifts to a True Post-Apocalyptic Setting as Diablo Triumphs over Sanctuary - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chidubem Ndubuisi ,\n1 days ago ​Blizzard Entertainment is officially taking the Diablo franchise in a fresh narrative direction, pushing the upcoming fifth main entry into a proper post-apocalyptic setting. Set 100 years after the events of Diablo 4, Diablo 5 abandons the traditional dark fantasy framing of an impending doom to explore the immediate aftermath of world-ending defeat. Sanctuary has finally fallen, and Lord Diablo himself has wiped out the world’s defenders to claim full dominion over the realm. Read full article",
